WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:01,700
That's pretty much it

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:05,690
Remember the time, don’t be late, boss

3
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,210
Didn't you pick her up at the airport?

4
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:11,540
Why do you want to say thank you, right?

5
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:16,250
Why did I say thank you just now? Yes, yes, she can't be cold.

6
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,210
Yuyu’s quilt is too small and there aren’t enough quilts at home.

7
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,610
I have to buy two beds quickly and come back with dinner.

8
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:22,770
She seems to like to eat braised pork bar boss one day

9
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:28,240
Wherever you are going, it’s already noon

10
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,040
Where did you go after a while? There was someone just now

11
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,480
Ask Brother Lin to help pick you up at the airport

12
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,240
It seems that she is called Sister Ya

13
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:40,620
Then Brother Lin went out in a hurry. If you understand this, it's not surprising.

14
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:41,940
You will understand everything
